@minutobauli is An Italian bakery that recently opened in NYC serving up some freshly baked sweet breads filled with cream, jam and delicious toppings worth trying.

📍866 Broadway NY

#pastries #sweetie #bakeries #yummy #nycfood #reels

@minutobauli recently opened their doors in NYC where they’re serving up soft oven baked Italian pastries (known as the minuto bauli) that you can custom fill with different spreads and toppings 😍

They sent me a DIY box which came with hazelnut and pistachio spreads and toppings and I was so impressed with my little creation ✨ These were insanely delicious fresh and bursting with flavor. They’re seriously bites of happiness and I can’t wait to go try more. Make sure to go check out their Union Square location asap!! 

#dessert #diy #nycdessert #minutobauli #italian #italiandessert #dessertlover #nyc #nycfoodie #hazelnut #pistachio

Dreaming of an Italian 🇮🇹 summer but stuck stateside? 

@minutobauli has brought their artisanal treats from Verona to Union Square. The recipe for the pastries dates back to 1922 and the family still uses the Futura Mother Yeast in production (props for keeping the sourdough starter alive that long!). 

Many of the ingredients are imported from Italy and you can customize your Minuto Bauli with filllings like pistachio cream & 🍓🫐 jam, and add on crunchy toppings like 🥜 🌰

